  "content": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n![Line](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dd7e30a42d1fd63e0b5d9fd08b2479e3519ec97a.webp)\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6b4ee6a132c230c4808e253a189db9ac6e5398c0.gif\" width=\"800\" alt=\"HyperPunchy Logo\">\n\n<br/>\n\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jg4P72EVkh\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8e3af1c09ba928d704d30b521fabe0690e9e51f1.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"50\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@hypdev\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3adf0adb90d27808bb64d4e4599235df84d05612.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"50\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/hamz_\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/17ac3e91ab87f0fa1c54ad7533b45225b0b7c7f3.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"50\">\n  </a>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n**終極 Punchy 體驗專用資源包。**\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eTmu74gIPA4\" title=\"YouTube 影片播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n![Line](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dd7e30a42d1fd63e0b5d9fd08b2479e3519ec97a.webp)\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/81e14a622c69a2e5ddb7ed33a98e38396612268c_0.webp\" width=\"0\" style=\"display:block; border:none;\">\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border:none; border-collapse:collapse; background:transparent;\">\n<tr>\n<td width=\"600\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" style=\"border:none;\">\n\n<br>\n\n**概述**\n\nHyperPunchy 旨在現代化標準動畫與材質，提供更流暢、更具反應性的遊戲體驗。它專為改善高速戰鬥與移動機制中的視覺回饋而設計，確保每次行動都充滿打擊感。\n\n<br>\n\n**主要特色**\n\n* **超過 100 種自訂動畫：** 大量翻新核心體驗，帶來獨特的手工動作。\n* **無縫轉換：** 優化動畫狀態，防止「卡頓」並確保視覺流程連貫。\n* **現代化材質：** 精緻的視覺效果，在保留經典 Minecraft 精神的同時增添現代感。\n* **面向未來設計：** 優化內部結構，為未來複雜的動畫更新做好準備。\n\n</td>\n<td width=\"400\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"center\" style=\"border:none;\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/606add918448d82f2cf28fb8c180931085f792ff_0.webp\" width=\"300\" style=\"display:block; border:none;\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n</div>\n\n> [!TIP] 為獲得最佳體驗，我們建議使用 **Iris/Oculus** 以及最新版本的 **Sodium**。\n\n![Line](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dd7e30a42d1fd63e0b5d9fd08b2479e3519ec97a.webp)\n\n<br>\n\n<div>\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/punchy-fpa\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3ac088c5b2259e0e679a7ff75b8df452f35eefcf_0.webp\" alt=\"Punchy\" width=\"250\"></a>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/respackopts\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/55506aec00f8db10edb1f93b923bf4c76aae3c19_0.webp\" alt=\"Respackopts\" width=\"250\"></a>\n\n</div>\n\n***也需要下載這個。***\n\n需要 Respackopts 來配置資源包設定。\n \n <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/18334a59a27759d90a328085cc3293564ae5de22.png\" width=\"700\" style=\"display:block; border:none;\">\n\n<br>\n\n![Line](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dd7e30a42d1fd63e0b5d9fd08b2479e3519ec97a.webp)\n\n### 授權與製作人員\n**授權：** 保留所有權利（ARR）。未經明確許可，嚴禁重新散布或修改。\n\n**平台：** 專為 Modrinth 社群設計。\n\n  <sub>HyperPunchy 是一個為強化「Punchy」體驗而建立的獨立專案。</sub>\n</div>",
